# Feature Demo Template
# Copy this file to demos/vhs/features/YOUR-FEATURE/demo.tape
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy to demos/vhs/features/your-feature/demo.tape
#   2. Update the output paths and commands
#   3. Run: make vhs-feature FEATURE=your-feature

Source demos/vhs/config.tape

# Update these output paths for your feature
Output demos/vhs/features/YOUR-FEATURE/demo.gif
Output demos/vhs/features/YOUR-FEATURE/demo.mp4

# Setup (hidden)
Hide
Type `mkdir -p /tmp/kariya-demo`
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type `cp demos/vhs/minimal-config.yaml /tmp/kariya-demo/config.yaml`
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "cd /home/baphled/Projects/KaRiya"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
# Optional: Import sample data if needed
# Type `./kariya --config /tmp/kariya-demo/config.yaml --db /tmp/kariya-demo/demo.db --import demos/vhs/sample-events.csv --skip-import-review > /dev/null 2>&1`
# Enter
# Sleep 2s
Show

# Launch KaRiya
Type "./kariya --config /tmp/kariya-demo/config.yaml --db /tmp/kariya-demo/demo.db"
Enter

# Wait for main menu
Sleep 2s

# === YOUR FEATURE DEMO STEPS HERE ===
#
# Navigation:
#   Down / Up          - Navigate menu/list
#   Enter              - Select / Confirm
#   Escape             - Go back / Cancel
#   Type "text"        - Type text
#   Type@100ms "text"  - Slow typing
#   Tab                - Next field
#   Ctrl+C             - Exit
#
# Timing:
#   Sleep 500ms        - Pause for 500ms
#   Sleep 2s           - Pause for 2 seconds
#
# Screenshots (for PR evidence):
#   Screenshot demos/vhs/features/YOUR-FEATURE/step1.png
#   Screenshot demos/vhs/features/YOUR-FEATURE/result.png
#
# Example:
#   Down
#   Enter
#   Sleep 1s
#   Screenshot demos/vhs/features/YOUR-FEATURE/feature-screen.png

# Exit
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
